            "block_id": "block-000115-2c911087",
            "quote": "some of them have their own boards with independent members and outside investors"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "收入来源方面，Alphabet 说明 Other Bets 的收入主要来自自动驾驶交通服务和互联网服务的销售；并且披露其中一些业务已经在产生收入。",
        "citations": [
          {
